"""
NyxForge Reverse Dutch Auction mockup generator.
Generates docs/storyboards/out/bounty-auction-mockup.html

A reverse Dutch auction for identical .bounty files:
  - Issuer lists N identical .bounty files (fixed collateral per file)
  - Asking price starts HIGH and descends over time
  - Backers commit at the current price; first to commit locks in that price
  - Once all N files are committed the auction closes at that clearing price
  - Discriminatory pricing: each backer pays what they committed at

5 frames:
  1. Auction Board     -- live auctions list, price + countdown + fill bar
  2. Auction Detail    -- price curve SVG, live feed, place bid CTA
  3. Confirm Bid       -- unit count, total cost, delivery address, confirm
  4. Settlement        -- auction closed, clearing price, claim .bounty files
  5. Create Auction    -- issuer setup: N files, start/floor price, decay, duration
"""
